                <td bgcolor="#f0f0f0" width="20%" valign="top"><b>Acceptance Criteria:</b></td>
                <td id="customfield_10041-10024-value" class="value" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="80%">      <ul>
	<li>The combined Database Table should include data from all specified tables.</li>
	<li>The Database Table should handle data type conflicts and ensure data integrity.</li>
	<li>The Database Table should be easily maintainable and updated with changes in the underlying tables.</li>
</ul>

